  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle oscillates with simple harmonic motion (SHM). The total distance travelled by the particle during one full oscillation is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span> m. The graph shows how the velocity of the particle varies with time. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the displacement of the particle?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sin (\\pi t)\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi \\sin (\\pi t)\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"- \\sin (\\pi t)\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"- \\pi \\sin (\\pi t)\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
